# Binaries
bin/

# Bare binaries at the repo root. `go build ./cmd/ultron-helper/` writes its
# output here by default, and a 10 MB Mach-O got committed that way before these
# lines existed. `bin/` alone does not cover it.
/ultron-ap
/ultron-helper

*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

